  "plan": "1. Write the Python solution to `/root/workspace/solution.py` implementing the required function. 2. The function will extract names from the PDF, fetch SMILES via PubChemPy, compute fingerprints via RDKit, calculate similarity, and return the top k sorted results.",
  "commands": [
